<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ALEX. BROWN UPS APPLIED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ALEX. BROWN UPS APPLIED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Applied Materials Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed Tuesday, Applied Materials posted third-quarter profit from operations of $0.77 a share, beating Wall Street estimates of $0.68 a share.</p>
<p>-- Applied gained 7-7/8 to 98-1/8.</p>
</text>
